+	    - BAR0 (0x10): 512B control registers (pcitest wire-format compatible)
+	    - BAR1 (0x14): 512B EDID (DRM sysfs or 1080p/4K fallback blob)
+	    - BAR2 (0x18): 64MB VRAM framebuffer (ioremap_wc, DT reserved-memory "vram")
