+	    - BAR4 (0x20): 4MB DPU95 register space (ioremap at 0x4b400000)
+	    - BAR5 (0x24): 1MB reserved
+	    - ROM  (0x30): Expansion ROM BAR (PCI_ROM_ADDRESS, not BAR6)
