+	    - KVM ready uevent to userspace (KVM_EVENT=kvm_ready)
+	    - pci_epf_get_vram_fb_address() exported for stream2v4l2
+	    - pci_epf_get_hid_address() exported for pcie-kvm-hid
 
 	  This driver is independent of PCI_EPF_TEST.
 
